  "_mirrorNote": "MTS is served from the Mobility Database mirror because sdmts.com refuses connections from non-browser clients (verified 2026-08-29, same failure class as FEMA). The mirror was checked for currency before wiring \u2014 service window and feed_version both current \u2014 and the feed-vintage machinery will flag it if the mirror ever falls behind.",
  "_sharedFeedNote": "BART, Caltrain and Eastern Sierra Transit cross county lines. The engine reads feeds per county and requires unique ids, so the same URL is registered once per county it serves (bart / bart_cc / bart_sm, caltrain / caltrain_sf / caltrain_sc, easternsierra / easternsierra_mono). The nightly pipeline downloads each registration separately; the files are under 1 MB."
}
